#![allow(clippy::excessive_precision)]
//! Golden-parity test for apply_climate_moisture_correctors (PARITY_TESTING.md).
//! Reference HTML lines 5188-5225 (applyClimateMoistureCorrectors).
//!
//! Unconditional in refreshClimate() -- unlike applyOceanCurrents/computeSeasons
//! (both opt-in, off by default, not yet ported), this corrector always runs
//! after simulateWeather(), so it's part of the MVP's default rainfall path.
//!
//! geoField omitted, matching compute_temperature's own reasoning:
//! state.planet.geoid.enabled defaults false, where JS's geoAt() always
//! returns 0 anyway.

